menu "ESP32 EFIS development options"

config EFIS_BENCH_SIMULATION
    bool "Enable synthetic bench flight data"
    default n
    help
        Development and emulator use only. Generates synthetic attitude,
        altitude and heading data. Leave disabled for normal hardware and
        aircraft-use builds. When enabled the display clearly identifies
        the data as simulated.

config EFIS_QEMU
    bool "Use Espressif QEMU virtual RGB display"
    default n
    depends on EFIS_BENCH_SIMULATION
    help
        Emulator development only. Replaces physical LCD, MCP23008, encoder,
        backlight and BMI088 initialization with Espressif's QEMU virtual RGB
        panel. Never enable this option for hardware or aircraft-use builds.

endmenu
